sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant DC as DriveConfig
    participant TS as TokenStorage
    participant GD as Google Drive

    Note over App,GD: Processus d'authentification
    
    App->>DC: initialize(credentials)
    DC->>TS: getStoredToken()
    
    alt Token exists
        TS-->>DC: Return token
        DC->>DC: validateToken()
        
        alt Token valid
            DC->>GD: Initialize API
        else Token expired
            DC->>DC: refreshToken()
            DC->>TS: storeNewToken()
        end
        
    else No token
        DC-->>App: Return auth URL
        App->>DC: authenticate(authCode)
        DC->>GD: getToken(authCode)
        GD-->>DC: Return new token
        DC->>TS: storeToken(newToken)
    end
    
    Note over App,GD: Token stocké et API initialisée